---
import { STORIES, renderStory } from '../lib/story-scenes';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
import StoryVolume from './StoryVolume.astro';
interface Props { id:string }
const {id}=Astro.props,story=STORIES[id],prefix=`story-${id}`;
---
<section class="story-lesson" id="resumo" tabindex="-1" data-story={id} data-story-base={u('')} data-story-mode-active="scene" role="group" aria-labelledby={`${prefix}-title`}>
  <header class="story-heading"><span class="meta">Sequência visual · 20 s</span><h2 id={`${prefix}-title`}>{story.title}</h2></header>
  <div class="story-viewport" data-story-viewport>
    <div class="story-stage" data-story-stage set:html={renderStory(id,0,prefix,u)} />
    <StoryVolume id={id} />
    <video data-story-film controls playsinline preload="none" poster={u(`/media/stories/${id}.webp`)} aria-label={`Vídeo: ${story.title}`} hidden>
      <source src={u(`/media/stories/${id}.mp4`)} type="video/mp4" />
      <track kind="captions" src={u(`/media/stories/${id}.vtt`)} srclang="pt-BR" label="Português" default />
      <p>Você pode <a href={u(`/media/stories/${id}.mp4`)}>abrir o vídeo</a> e ler a explicação abaixo.</p>
    </video>
  </div>
  <div class="story-modes" role="group" aria-label="Como você quer ver esta ideia">
    <button type="button" data-story-mode="scene" aria-pressed="true">Ilustração</button>
    <button type="button" data-story-mode="film" aria-pressed="false">Vídeo</button>
    <button type="button" data-volume-toggle aria-pressed="false">Explorar em 3D</button>
  </div>
  <p class="story-mode-note">Cena e vídeo compartilham a mesma posição.</p>
  <ol class="story-phases" aria-label="Momentos da explicação">
    {story.phases.map((phase,i)=><li><button type="button" data-story-phase={i} aria-current={i===0?'step':'false'}><span aria-hidden="true">{i+1}</span>{phase.label}</button></li>)}
  </ol>
  <div class="story-transport" role="group" aria-label="Controle da explicação">
    <button type="button" data-story-play aria-pressed="false"><span data-story-play-label>Reproduzir</span></button>
    <button type="button" data-story-reset>Recomeçar</button>
    <label class="story-time-label" for={`${prefix}-time`}>Momento <input type="range" id={`${prefix}-time`} min="0" max="20" step=".05" value="0" data-story-time /></label>
    <output for={`${prefix}-time`} data-story-clock>0:00 / 0:20</output>
  </div>
  <p class="story-caption" data-story-caption>{story.phases[0].say}</p>
  <p class="story-limit">{story.limit}</p>
  {(id==='galaxias-e-nebulosas'||id==='sistema-solar') && <p class="story-credit">Mapa da Terra · NASA Earth Observatory, Blue Marble / MODIS. Iluminação e nuvens ilustrativas. <a href={u('/fontes/')}>Créditos dos modelos ↗</a></p>}
  {id==='vida-das-estrelas' && <p class="story-credit">Órion · NASA, ESA, M. Robberto (STScI/ESA) e Hubble Space Telescope Orion Treasury Project Team. <a href="https://esahubble.org/images/heic0601a/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Imagem original ↗</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Recorte da imagem.</p>}
  {id==='terra-e-atmosfera' && <p class="story-credit">Horizonte da Terra · NASA, Estação Espacial Internacional. <a href={u('/fontes/')}>Fonte da fotografia ↗</a></p>}
  <details class="story-transcript"><summary>Ler a explicação</summary><ol>{story.phases.map(phase=><li><strong>{phase.label}.</strong> {phase.say}</li>)}</ol><p>Vídeo ilustrativo, sem narração. Você escolhe o ritmo pelos controles.</p><a href={u(`/media/stories/${id}.mp4`)}>Abrir o vídeo de 20 segundos ↗</a></details>
  <noscript><p>A cena acima mostra o primeiro momento. Leia as três etapas em “Ler a explicação” ou abra o vídeo.</p></noscript>
</section>
<style>
  .story-lesson .story-heading h2 {font-family:var(--serif,Georgia,serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.65rem);line-height:1.06;margin:.35em 0 .65em}
  .story-lesson .story-viewport {border-radius:2px;background:#06090e;isolation:isolate}
  .story-lesson .story-modes {margin-top:.8rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .story-lesson .story-credit {font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin:.3rem 0}
  @media(max-width:620px){
    .story-lesson .story-viewport {margin-inline:calc(-1 * min(2.5vw,10px));width:calc(100% + min(5vw,20px))}
    .story-lesson .story-phases button {border-radius:2px}
    .story-lesson .story-heading h2 {font-size:1.7rem}
  }
  :global(.experience-dialog) .story-viewport {margin:0;width:100%}
  :global(.experience-dialog) .story-heading h2 {font-size:1.35rem;margin:0}
</style>
